## 2. Data model (already in Postgres, migration `0001`)

```
people ──< email_recipients >── emails
people ──< event_attendees  >── calendar_events
                                       │
                                   audit_log   (every deploy action, eventually every AI action)
```

Worth knowing before Milestone 3: `emails` **already has** `category` and
`importance` columns sitting unused. The DeepSeek classifier doesn't need a new
migration — it needs to start writing to columns that already exist. Don't
recreate them.

Also unused so far: `organizer_id` on `calendar_events` and the whole
`event_attendees` table — the current `gcal.ts` upsert doesn't populate people
at all. That's a real gap, not a design decision yet — flag it before Milestone 3
Q&A needs to answer "who's coming to X."

